cek apakah ada button detail di button detail

    ${is_visible}=    Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...    SeleniumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible
    ...    //button[normalize-space()='Detail']
    ...    3s

    IF    ${is_visible}
        Log To Console    Button DETAIL ditemukan
        SeleniumLibrary.Click Element    //button[normalize-space()='Detail']
    ELSE
        Skip    Button DETAIL tidak ditemukan
    END


cek apakah ada button detail dan varian di button detail
    ${is_visible}=    Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...    SeleniumLibrary.Wait Until Element Is Visible
    ...    //button[normalize-space()='DETAIL & VARIAN']
    ...    3s

    IF    ${is_visible}
        Log To Console    Button DETAIL ditemukan
        SeleniumLibrary.Click Element    //button[normalize-space()='DETAIL & VARIAN']
    ELSE
        Skip    Button DETAIL & Varian tidak ditemukan
    END

